    {
      "name": "ChatThread",
      "note": "Fixture-shaped composition of the shared ChatUserBubble, bubbleless ChatBubble and Workspace ChatComposer. The 848px reference frame includes two 40px host gutters around the 768px reading column; transcript prose has a further 16px inset. It paints the native content layer once, with transparent chat content and translucent card/user surfaces above it. Actual Mica depends on the desktop, activation and transparency settings, so the browser's neutral backplate is not an exact wallpaper-dependent Mica reproduction. Native timeline virtualization, anchored composer placement and responsive gutters remain host behavior.",
      "root": {
        "id": "chat-thread-root",
        "el": "div",
        "layout": {
          "mode": "vertical",
          "gap": "3",
          "width": 848,
          "padding": { "x": "chatGutter", "y": "4" }
        },
        "appearance": { "background": "chatLayer" },
        "children": [
