    {
      "name": "WorkspaceShell",
      "note": "The native Home and Sessions workspace shell from Windows/WorkspaceWindow.xaml (#1541): the landing window. A Mica window (previewed as `paper`) with a title bar, a 256px left NavigationView pane, and a content host that mounts the Reactor chat (see ChatThread). The pane stacks a Back/Forward toolbar and an assistant selector (transparent ComboBox over AgentIdentityBadge; a New agent option adds `add` glyph U+E710) in the PaneHeader; a Home item and a Sessions header with an inline add button, then reusable session rows, in the menu; and an Owner button plus a Notifications bell (with an InfoBadge count and the NotificationFlyout) in the PaneFooter. The Owner button reads the authenticated users.self profile (display name over a live connection-status caption, honest Owner / Disconnected fallback). Selection is single across the pane like a NavigationView: exactly one destination (Home or a session) is selected at a time (shown here on Home), using the native subtle selection background with a leading `accent` indicator; nav rows use `sm` (ControlCornerRadius) corners. Toolbar/selector/footer subtle buttons are transparent with `subtleHover`/`subtlePressed` states. Pane hide/reopen, exact-key Back/Forward history, and Owner MenuFlyout live in WorkspaceWindow/WindowManager and are port notes.",
      "props": {
        "owner": "Fixture Owner",
        "status": "Connected"
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "workspace-root",
        "el": "div",
        "layout": {
          "mode": "vertical",
          "width": "fill",
          "height": 560
        },
        "appearance": {
          "background": "paper",
          "color": "ink"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "workspace-titlebar",
            "el": "div",
            "layout": {
              "mode": "horizontal",
              "align": "center",
              "gap": "2",
              "padding": {
                "x": "3",
                "y": "2"
              },
              "width": "fill"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "workspace-title",
                "el": "span",
                "appearance": {
                  "fontFamily": "body",
                  "textStyle": "caption",
                  "color": "muted"
                },
                "children": [
                  "OpenClaw"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "workspace-body",
            "el": "div",
            "layout": {
              "mode": "horizontal",
              "width": "fill",
              "grow": true
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "workspace-pane",
                "el": "nav",
                "layout": {
                  "mode": "vertical",
                  "gap": "3",
                  "padding": "2",
                  "width": 256,
                  "height": "fill"
                },
                "appearance": {
                  "borderColor": "line"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "workspace-pane-header",
                    "el": "div",
                    "layout": {
                      "mode": "vertical",
                      "gap": "2",
                      "width": "fill"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "id": "workspace-toolbar",
                        "el": "div",
                        "layout": {
                          "mode": "horizontal",
                          "gap": "2",
                          "justify": "end",
                          "width": "fill"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "workspace-back",
                            "el": "div",
                            "attrs": {
                              "role": "button",
                              "aria-label": "Back"
                            },
                            "layout": {
                              "mode": "horizontal",
                              "align": "center",
                              "justify": "center",
                              "width": 40,
                              "height": 40
                            },
                            "appearance": {
                              "color": "muted",
                              "radius": "sm"
                            },
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "id": "workspace-back-glyph",
                                "el": "svg",
                                "attrs": {
                                  "width": "16",
                                  "height": "16",
                                  "viewBox": "0 0 24 24",
                                  "fill": "none",
